Third-party components
----------------------

* third_party/gmod-module-base - Facepunch Studios' Garry's Mod binary-module headers,
  https://github.com/Facepunch/gmod-module-base (branch "development", commit
  e0156e5f96cd0bad8eed738f0d20e2c9a14b2a0d). Included as a git SUBMODULE, not copied into this repository: upstream
  publishes no licence file, so its terms are Facepunch's. The headers are only used to compile the module's Lua
  binding.

* libsa1 - linked statically into the module. Built from https://github.com/ExtCan/LibSA1 (GPL-3.0; see its own
  NOTICE).

* BASS (un4seen developments) is NOT part of G-SA1: at run time the module calls the copy that Garry's Mod ships and has
  already loaded.

Game data
---------

No SEGA data is included in this repository or in G-SA1's releases. Sonic Adventure's models, textures, animations,
sounds and music are read at run time from the user's own disc image. Sonic Adventure, Sonic the Hedgehog and the
characters are trademarks of SEGA; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by SEGA or Facepunch Studios.
